---
title: Params
params:
  n: 2
  name: "east"
  tags: [a, b]
  limits: {low: 1, high: 2.5}
  missing: ~
owner: someone   # any other key is allowed and ignored
---

Each param is a top-level `let`, its type from its YAML value.

```olang
println(`${typeof(n)} ${typeof(name)} ${typeof(tags)} ${typeof(limits)}`)
println(`${n + 1} ${name} ${len(tags)} ${limits.high} ${missing == ()}`)
```

```olang
test "a param is in scope in a test" {
    assert_eq(n * 2, 4)
}
```
